Third-party content distributed with this repository:

- The runnable JAR of ocr-pro-cli bundles Apache PDFBox, Apache PDFBox io, Apache FontBox and
  Apache Commons Logging (Apache-2.0, Copyright The Apache Software
  Foundation). PDFBox and FontBox include the Adobe Glyph List, the Zapf
  Dingbats Glyph List, Unicode data files, parts of TwelveMonkeys ImageIO and a
  CC0 ICC profile. The LICENSE and NOTICE file of each library is in
  META-INF/third-party/ inside the JAR.
- models/: PP-OCR weights and character dictionaries by the PaddlePaddle
  Authors (PaddleOCR), in the ONNX form published by RapidOCR (Apache-2.0);
  the sjp.pl Polish word list (Apache-2.0, among other licenses); the SCOWL
  English word list (Copyright 2000-2011 Kevin Atkinson and others, full
  notice in models/LICENSE-SCOWL.txt); GeoNames postal codes for Poland
  (CC BY 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/,
  https://www.geonames.org/). Details are in models/NOTICE. The JARs
  ocr-pro-models and ocr-pro-models-pl ship these files unchanged, with
  models/NOTICE (and LICENSE-SCOWL.txt) in META-INF/models/.
- The detection and recognition pre- and post-processing follow PaddleOCR
  (Apache-2.0); the code here is written anew in Java.
- ocr-pro/src/test/resources/quality/: three scans from Wikimedia Commons used
  only as test fixtures (public domain and CC BY-SA 4.0), unchanged copies.
  Details are in ocr-pro/src/test/resources/quality/ATTRIBUTION.md.
- bench/data/ and bench/ref/: benchmark page images, the PDF and DjVu
  documents they are rendered from, and their reference transcriptions,
  from Wikimedia Commons, Wikisource, EUR-Lex, arXiv and Polish digital
  libraries (public domain, CC0, CC BY and CC BY-SA). These files are not
  under the Apache License: each keeps the license of its source. The source
  URL, license and author of each are in bench/manifest.tsv, and
  bench/README.md links the license texts.
